{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["Rejoice, O nations — over His people. As in: ״הללו את ה' כל גוים שבחוהו כל האומים״ — and put faith in Him, for His kindness has prevailed over us — more than over the other nations. Therefore praise Him and put faith in Him, and may He prevail over you as over us; so too here: rejoice and praise Him and serve Him, and so may He do for you if you fear Him and serve Him." "And He will atone His land, His people — He will wipe clean the blood of His people from the land through the shedding of the blood of their enemies. As it is written: ולארץ לא יכופר לדם אשר שפך בה כי אם בדם שופכו."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:40:00.558998696Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}